## Hints

- E2: mixture kurtosis — compute E[z⁴] of the mixture by
  law of total expectation (0.999·3·1 + 0.001·3·4⁴... careful with
  normalization: for N(0,σ²), E[z⁴] = 3σ⁴).
- E3: rejection rate at n=60 for t(5) is typically well under 50% —
  the test is half-blind exactly where strategy evaluation lives.
